---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Workshops — Ruijie Wu" description="Workshops and learning spaces exploring movement, embodiment and psychology.">
  <section class="page-intro container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Workshops &amp; learning / 03</span>
    <h1>Thinking through<br /><em>movement.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Spaces to explore the body as a source of expression, relationship, imagination and knowledge.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="workshop-intro container">
    <div class="workshop-quiet-mark">A space<br />to move<br />and notice.</div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>These spaces are not about dancing well or producing a beautiful result. They invite participants to notice what movement makes possible, to experiment at their own pace, and to discover forms of expression that may not begin with words.</p>
      <p>Workshop themes, formats and collaborations are developed in response to the group and context.</p>
      <p>Images from group work are shared only with appropriate permission. Where participants appear, identifying facial details are blurred in the public version; original photographs are kept separate from the public website.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Possible points of exploration</span>
      <div class="workshop-topics">
        <span>Body awareness</span><span>Space &amp; relationship</span><span>Movement narratives</span><span>Group process</span><span>Emotion &amp; gesture</span><span>Creative expression</span>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}contact/`}>Discuss a collaboration <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
